         <head>A Paris pair; Their day's doings</head>
         <author>Beatrice Bradshaw Brown</author>
         <author>BEATRICE BRADSHAW BROWN ILLUSTRATED BY BARBARA HAVEN BROWN NEW YORK E. P. DUTTON &amp; COMPANY 681 Fifth Avenue Copyright, 1923, By E. P. DUTTON &amp; COMPANY All Rights Reserved. Printed in the United States of America TO F. B. B. A PARIS PAIR</author>
