         <p>A PARIS PAIR</p>
         <head>A PARIS PAIR</head>
         <p>THEIR DAY’S DOINGS<lb/>
         </p>
         <author>BY<lb/>BEATRICE BRADSHAW BROWN<lb/>
            <lb/>ILLUSTRATED BY<lb/>BARBARA HAVEN BROWN<lb/>
            <lb/>
            <lb/>NEW YORK<lb/>E. P. DUTTON &amp; COMPANY<lb/>681 Fifth Avenue<lb/>
            <lb/>
            <lb/>Copyright, 1923,<lb/>By E. P. DUTTON &amp; COMPANY<lb/>
            <lb/>
            <hi rend="italic">All Rights Reserved.</hi>
            <lb/>
            <lb/>
            <hi rend="italic">Printed in the United States of America</hi>
            <lb/>
            <lb/>
            <lb/>TO<lb/>F. B. B.<lb/>
            <lb/>
            <lb/>
            <lb/>A PARIS PAIR</author>
         <pb/>
         <div type="div1">
            <head>A Paris pair; Their day's doings</head>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>EIGHT O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>JEANETTE is not a sleepy-head;</l>
                  <l>An easy task, to wake her!</l>
                  <l>At eight o’clock she springs from bed—</l>
                  <l>No need to call or shake her.</l>
                  <l>Her brother Jean—I grieve to state—</l>
                  <l>His patient <hi rend="italic">bonne</hi> distresses;</l>
                  <l>’Tis often nearer nine than eight</l>
                  <l>Before at last he dresses.</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">EIGHT O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>NINE O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>FOR <hi rend="italic">déjeuner</hi> our children eat</l>
                  <l>A bowl of milk and bit of bread;</l>
                  <l>Or sometimes, for a special treat,</l>
                  <l>A <hi rend="italic">croissant</hi>, crisp and fresh, instead.</l>
                  <l>Jeanette displays her bringing up,</l>
                  <l>For daintily she sips and lingers.</l>
                  <l>Her brother drains his brimming cup,</l>
                  <l>And then—oh, horror!—licks his fingers!</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">NINE O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>TEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>AT ten o’clock the teacher comes</l>
                  <l>Bringing books and dreadful sums.</l>
                  <l>Jeanette’s patience never fails,</l>
                  <l>But Jean his lesson-time bewails.</l>
                  <l>For boys have better things to do</l>
                  <l>Than multiplying two by two!</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">TEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>ELEVEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>THE Luxembourg is a jolly place</l>
                  <l>To roll your hoop, and to run a race</l>
                  <l>With a gallant yacht, and win, of course,</l>
                  <l>Or caper about on a mettled horse!</l>
                  <l>And your heart is gay and your cheeks are bright—</l>
                  <l>And home you go with an appetite!</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">ELEVEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>TWELVE O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>LUNCHEON never comes too soon,</l>
                  <l>For we are nearly starved at noon!</l>
                  <l>Spinach and an omelette,</l>
                  <l>Salad, too, and better yet</l>
                  <l>Delicious jam with creamy cheese—</l>
                  <l>A dish that’s very sure to please!</l>
                  <l>Becoming gratitude they feel,</l>
                  <l>And thank <hi rend="italic">le bon Dieu</hi> for their meal.</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">TWELVE O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>THIRTEEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>LUNCHEON done,</l>
                  <l>They nap at one;</l>
                  <l>Truth to tell,</l>
                  <l>The two rebel.</l>
                  <l>Sleep was made for night, they say,</l>
                  <l>And never for a sunny day!</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">THIRTEEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>FOURTEEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>WE think it quite a jolly lark</l>
                  <l>To go a-riding in the park.</l>
                  <l>Jeanette’s mount is safe and sure,</l>
                  <l>Upon his back she sits secure.</l>
                  <l>But Jean—another matter, quite!</l>
                  <l>His steed is proud and full of fight.</l>
                  <l>“<hi rend="italic">Oo-là-là!</hi>” His <hi rend="italic">bonne</hi> cries out—</l>
                  <l>“You’ll break your neck without a doubt!”</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">FOURTEEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>FIFTEEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>EVERY perfect Frenchman’s heart</l>
                  <l>Thrills in keen response to Art.</l>
                  <l>Great his rapture when he sees a</l>
                  <l>Venus or a Mona Lisa;</l>
                  <l>And incomplete his education</l>
                  <l>Lacking Art Appreciation.</l>
                  <l>So our pair must learn to know</l>
                  <l>Da Vinci, Titian and Corot.</l>
                  <l>Their teacher knows the surest way:</l>
                  <l>She takes them to the Louvre each day.</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">FIFTEEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>SIXTEEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>FEET were made to dance on, truly;</l>
                  <l>But Jean’s too often are unruly.</l>
                  <l>Now a dip and now a slide—</l>
                  <l>Watch the graceful Jeanette glide!</l>
                  <l>High upon her tippy-toes,</l>
                  <l>Light as gentlest breeze that blows.</l>
                  <l>Now a slip and now a stumble—</l>
                  <l>See her brother trip and tumble</l>
                  <l>Flat upon his nose!</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">SIXTEEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>SEVENTEEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>AT five o’clock we take our tea;</l>
                  <l>Lighted candles on the table.</l>
                  <l>Sister dainty as can be,</l>
                  <l>And Brother good as he is able.</l>
                  <l>But he is generous through and through,</l>
                  <l>And gives Minette a bite or two.</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">SEVENTEEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>EIGHTEEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>AFTER tea it’s very jolly</l>
                  <l>To play with train and Mistress Dolly.</l>
                  <l>Over mountains, under tunnels,</l>
                  <l>Roaring flames and smoking funnels—</l>
                  <l>Hear the engine clank and clatter!</l>
                  <l>Drowning Jeanette’s quiet chatter</l>
                  <l>As she hugs her dolly tight</l>
                  <l>And makes her ready for the night.</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">EIGHTEEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>NINETEEN O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>LIFE is not alone for fun;</l>
                  <l>There are lessons to be done.</l>
                  <l>But oh, how hard to concentrate</l>
                  <l>On three from six and five times eight</l>
                  <l>When there’s a train upon the floor,</l>
                  <l>And bandits lurking by the door!</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">NINETEEN O’CLOCK</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>TWENTY O’CLOCK</head>
               <lg>
                  <l>A DAY that’s filled with pleasant things</l>
                  <l>Hastens by as if on wings.</l>
                  <l>It seems you scarce have gotten up</l>
                  <l>Before it’s time again to sup,</l>
                  <l>And say your prayers, and go to bed,</l>
                  <l>And dream of happiness ahead.</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
               <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
               <p rend="justify">TWENTY O’CLOCK</p>
            </div>
         </div>
      </body>
